; Written by hand, not generated by c64-source: source.ts generate keeps this file.
; Boot part: the bytes of the generated loader (stage 2) at $2000-$35ff. The sample of the
; loading stage uses these addresses while it plays. boot.asm copies them back after the sample.
; The loader loads at $0801, so $2000 is at offset 2 + $2000 - $0801 of its file.
!cpu 6510
* = $9b00
boot_stash_bytes
        !binary "fist_v1_loader.prg", $1600, 2 + $2000 - $0801
